# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the third-party JIT.
#
# GNU LibJIT is an uninstrumented dependency. Its process-wide context/type
# caches are intentionally freed only by process teardown, so they are the one
# allocation family the ASan gate suppresses. Nothing in WasmBase, LibJit/ or
# the helper layer is suppressed: an engine leak must fail this run.
leak:libjit
